<title>USA: CEM Corp Q3 shr $0.11 vs $0.18.</title>
<headline>CEM Corp Q3 shr $0.11 vs $0.18.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>CEM CORP</p>
<p>			    Financial Highlights</p>
<p>				(Unaudited)</p>
<p>					  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						March 31</p>
<p>					   1997	    1996  % Change</p>
<p> Net sales			 $7,138,000    $7,518,000    (5%)</p>
<p> Net income			   391,000	 676,000   (42%)</p>
<p> Earnings per share		    0.11	    0.18   (39%)</p>
